atp (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * AQL v2: variables (let), conditionals (if/else/end), group-by with
    aggregations, user-defined functions (def/call).
  * Configuration system: ~/.atp/config.toml and per-project .atprc.
  * MCP server mode for AI agent integration (JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio).
  * Performance: parallel file search (rayon), memory-mapped I/O (mmap).
  * VS Code extension with AQL syntax highlighting and LSP client.
  * Property-based testing (proptest) and fuzz harness (cargo-fuzz).
  * Benchmark regression CI gate.

 -- Nervosys <opensource@nervosys.ai>  Mon, 01 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

atp (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.

